
USAGE
        Nodes [<pattern> | <nodecall> ...]

DESCRIPTION
        Shows the FPAC nodes known to the White Pages of this node.
        Each node is listed with the callsign to give to the Connect
        command and with its ROSE address (DNIC and address).

        The callsign shown is the one users connect to. It is not the
        callsign the node uses on its links with the other nodes,
        which carries another SSID and appears in the Users and
        Routes commands.

        With a pattern (wildcards * and ?) or one or more callsigns,
        the matching nodes are listed with their country, locator and
        city.

        The NET/ROM nodes are listed by the NEtrom command.
